#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "84_Akiyama"
msgid "(Hey, isn't that our scout?)"
msgstr "(Eh, ¿ese de ahí no es nuestro querido reclutador?)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "120_Akiyama"
msgid "Working hard? Don't be slacking off, now."
msgstr "¿Descansando en horario laboral? Vamos, eres un jovencito. A trabajar."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "144_Lame Scout"
msgid "Oh, hey there, boss."
msgstr "Ah... ¡Es el jefecito! Buenas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "156_Akiyama"
msgid "Don't \"hey there, boss\" me. All these girls walking by...\\r\nYou've got to talk to them."
msgstr "¡Nada de “buenas”! Mira todas las chicas que pasan por aquí... Debes que hablarles."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "180_Akiyama"
msgid "Like that one!"
msgstr "¡Oh, como esa!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "192_Akiyama"
msgid "...Aw, some other club got her."
msgstr "Ahh... Parece que otro club se nos adelantó."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "204_Lame Scout"
msgid "I'm just not cut out for this job."
msgstr "¡No sirvo para reclutar chicas!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "216_Akiyama"
msgid "What, quitting already? It's your choice to make, but you're\\r\nbeing a little hasty, don't you think?"
msgstr "¿Ehhh? ¿Ya vas a renunciar? Es tu decisión, pero ¿no crees que es algo impulsivo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "240_Lame Scout"
msgid "It's just that nothing's going right."
msgstr "Es solo que nada está saliendo bien"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "252_Lame Scout"
msgid "I call out to some girl and she either glares at me or\\r\nignores me altogether. I'm starting to get a complex here."
msgstr "Cada vez que me acerco a una chica, o me mira con desprecio o me ignora completamente. Voy a terminar odiándolas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "264_Akiyama"
msgid "It sounds like you talked to a lot of girls. How many leads\\r\ndid you get today?"
msgstr "Vaya, parece que hablaste con muchas mujeres.\n¿Cuántas picaron hoy?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "276_Lame Scout"
msgid "Leads?"
msgstr "¿Picaron?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "288_Akiyama"
msgid "C'mon, you know. How many phone numbers did you get? How\\r\nmany girls?"
msgstr "Vamos, ya sabes. ¿Cuántos números conseguiste? ¿Cuántas chicas?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "300_Lame Scout"
msgid "One."
msgstr "Solo una."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "312_Akiyama"
msgid "You've got to be kidding! I'll be living off bread crusts\\r\nand water at this rate."
msgstr "¡Si serás! ¡Tienes que estar de broma! A este ritmo vas a terminar comiendo pan y agua."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "324_Lame Scout"
msgid "I'm not too happy about it myself, you know. I wish there\\r\nwere an easier way to make money."
msgstr "Sabe, esto también me deprime. Ahhh... ojalá existiera una forma más sencilla de conseguir dinero..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "336_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, I think I can understand how you feel... Just how are\\r\nyou calling out to these girls anyway?"
msgstr "Bueno, creo que entiendo cómo te sientes... ¿Puedes decirme cómo te acercas a las chicas?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "348_Lame Scout"
msgid "How? Like, normally. \"Hey, wanna be a hostess?\" Like that."
msgstr "¿Cómo? Pues usualmente les digo algo como: \"¡Hola! ¿Te gustaría ser una hostess?\""

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "360_Akiyama"
msgid "Hmm. Then what? What if she says she's not interested?"
msgstr "Mmm... ¿Y después qué? ¿Qué dices si ella no está interesada?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "372_Lame Scout"
msgid "I say, \"Aw, c'mon, why not? Give it a shot.\""
msgstr "Le digo: \"Vamos, ¿por qué no? Dale una oportunidad\"."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "384_Akiyama"
msgid "...I don't blame them for giving you the stink eye."
msgstr "...No las culpo por ponerte mala cara."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "396_Akiyama"
msgid "Maybe it was fate I saw you here today. I'll give you some\\r\nbasic lessons in scouting. Whether you learn anything is up\\r\nto you."
msgstr "Quizás fue el destino el que nos juntó. Te daré unas lecciones básicas de reclutador. Que aprendas o no, eso ya será cosa tuya."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "408_Lame Scout"
msgid "Huh? You mean you can scout, boss?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Sabe reclutar chicas, jefecito?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Bas
msgctxt "420_Akiyama"
msgid "What kind of idiot do you take me for? I tried my hand at\\r\nall kinds of hostess club jobs before I came to own one\\r\nmyself."
msgstr "¿Por quién me tomas? Trabajé en muchos clubs antes de ser dueño de uno."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "432_Lame Scout"
msgid "Wow. You sure don't mess around."
msgstr "Vaya. No se anda con rodeos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "444_Akiyama"
msgid "Not when it comes to work, anyway; that's the trick to\\r\ngetting rich. Now it's time for you to take that first step.\\r\nCome with me."
msgstr "No cuando se trata de trabajo. Ese es el truco para hacerse rico. Es hora de que des ese primer paso. Ven conmigo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "480_Lame Scout"
msgid "Aw, do I have to?"
msgstr "Agh, ¿hace falta?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "492_Akiyama"
msgid "Yep. Now, get movin'!"
msgstr "Claro que sí. ¡Andando!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "504_Lame Scout"
msgid "Seriously? What a drag..."
msgstr "¿En serio? Qué pereza..."

